A photorealistic concert scene from the audience perspective, showing silhouetted heads and raised hands in the foreground, with warm amber and magenta stage lights cutting through atmospheric haze, illuminating a small intimate venue where a band performs on a modest wooden stage, guitar necks and microphone stands visible as dark shapes against the glowing backdrop, the energy of live music captured in the motion blur of a drummer's arm and the lean of a singer toward the crowd, sweat and passion visible in the humid Singapore night air.
